;; A space station high above the 3-1 coin heaven, reached by the teleport pad hidden in a block
;; past the end of its clouds (3-1-sky). The player beams down onto the arrival pad; captive
;; Mega Man waits on the command deck under the big window (Earth below the stars), and the
;; return pad just past him beams the player back down into 3-1 at column 162, where the coin
;; heaven's drop lands (the arrival pad goes there too, once stepped off). Theme `castle` stands
;; in for `station` until the station art lands.

